# - T plus R is about 99.8 percent, so roughly 0.2 percent is absorbed or scattered.
# - Emissivity is held at 0, so this surface adds no thermal emission. Negligible below 1.1 um.
# - Valid range is 0.30 to 1.10 um. Do not extrapolate beyond it.
